👑🧠 Birbal and the Foolish Thief (Raw Story)

One night, a thief broke into a rich man’s house.

He stole many valuable things and tried to escape.

But the guards caught him and brought him to Emperor Akbar.

Akbar asked, “Why did you steal?”

The thief said, “I am poor and needed money.”

Akbar was unsure what to do.

Birbal stepped forward and said, “Let me test him.”

Birbal gave the thief a gold coin and said, “Keep this safe and return it tomorrow.”

The next day, the thief returned with the coin.

Birbal smiled and said, “You could keep this coin but you returned it. That means you can be honest.”

Akbar understood and gave the thief a chance to change.

💖 Moral:

Everyone deserves a chance to change and do better.
